{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026TFMdv7tIvl1792905062.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>朝鮮官方媒體發布領袖金正恩訪問遼寧丹東消息，指永遠不會忘記中國人民抗美援朝的歷史。</p><p></p><p>朝鮮中央電視台發放金正恩訪華片段，指全國政協主席王滬寧迎接金正恩到訪時轉達了國家主席習近平的問候，又稱金正恩在抗美援朝76周年，專程到訪抗美援朝紀念館，對中朝傳統友好及戰鬥友誼具有重大意義。金正恩表示，如今中國享有的國際威望和尊嚴，是在習近平英明領導下的應有結果。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.KIM-1300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026SNqM57R5n51792905064.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>報道又提到王滬寧受習近平指示，設宴歡迎金正恩。</p><p></p><p>金正恩行程結束時在中朝新鴨綠江大橋上俯瞰全景，期待大橋完成使兩國相連的歷史使命。報道又指，金正恩此行證明朝中兩國友好團結，關係堅如磐石。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.KIM-1300_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026oD3QNv529m1792905056.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T08:23:48.548381+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":267,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T05:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:16.613296+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T08:20:13.309369+00:00","content_hash":"fb43bd28f07b81daa9e7babeafaac8dc649a9f456b82e03eca52377cc04cf614","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-25T08:23:48.548381+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}